libphdi
------------------------------------------
libphdi is a library to access the Parallels Hard Disk image (PHDI) format.

Runtime requirements:
  cygfuse-3.2.0-3
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbfio1-20260623-1bl1
  libcdata1-20260703-1bl1
  libcdirectory1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libclocale1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libcpath1-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads1-20260703-1bl1
  libfcache1-20260520-1bl1
  libfdata1-20260521-1bl1
  libfguid1-20260521-1bl1
  libfvalue1-20260531-1bl1
  libintl8-0.22.5-1
  libphdi-devel-20260902-1bl1
  libphdi1-20260902-1bl1
  libuna1-20260602-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1

