  https://github.com/libyal/libphdi/archive/refs/tags/20260902.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libphdi-20260902-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libphdi-20260902-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libphdi-20260902-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libphdi-20260902-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libphdi1-20260902-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libphdi-devel-20260902-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libphdi-20260902-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libphdi)
  /usr/bin/phdiinfo.exe
  /usr/bin/phdimount.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libphdi.README
  /usr/share/doc/libphdi/AUTHORS
